{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15210280","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1521028001:0":{"text":"제발, 제발... 아빠를 해치지 마세요. 흑흑...","source_cn":"不要，不要……你们不要伤害我爸爸！呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85516FF6DD7A826E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521028002:0":{"text":"카토! 왜 여기까지 온 거야? 고모랑 같이 있으라고 했잖아!","source_cn":"卡托！你怎么跑出来了？爸爸明明让你和姑姑待在一起！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BFE80B6D56CB14B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521028003:0":{"text":"흑흑흑... 아빠, 다른 사람 물건 뺏지 마... 나 배 안 고파. 하나도 안 고프니까 남의 거 안 뺏어도 돼...","source_cn":"呜呜呜……爸爸，你不要抢别人的东西……卡托不饿，一点都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3061DED8CE474581","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521028004:1":{"text":"아이를 위해서 그런 거였군요.","source_cn":"原来你是为了孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62953F18A334234B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521028005:0":{"text":"아버지와 아들...","source_cn":"一个父亲，还有一个儿子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90355A8A21E9B551","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521028006:0":{"text":"그래... 용서해 줄게.\n호위대장, 가지고 있는 식량을 이들에게 나눠줘.","source_cn":"好吧……我原谅你了。\\n护卫长官，把包里的食物分给他们一些。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA6ADDDDEE113DAD6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래... 용서해 줄게.\n호위대장, 가지고 있는 식량을 이들에게 나눠줘.","female":"그래... 용서해 줄게.\n호위대장, 가지고 있는 식량을 이들에게 나눠줘.","variant_male_record_index":"181761","variant_female_record_index":"181762","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1521028006":{"text":"그래... 용서해 줄게.\n호위대장, 가지고 있는 식량을 이들에게 나눠줘.","source_cn":"好吧……我原谅你了。\\n护卫长官，把包里的食物分给他们一些。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA6ADDDDEE113DAD6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래... 용서해 줄게.\n호위대장, 가지고 있는 식량을 이들에게 나눠줘.","female":"그래... 용서해 줄게.\n호위대장, 가지고 있는 식량을 이들에게 나눠줘.","variant_male_record_index":"181761","variant_female_record_index":"181762","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521028007:0":{"text":"와, 빵이다! 빵 정말 오랜만에 먹어봐요!","source_cn":"哇——是面包！我好久都没吃到面包了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57DEF1F23B24E19F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521028008:1":{"text":"아빠, 아빠도 같이 먹자!","source_cn":"爸爸，你也一起吃——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x594D893708163A9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521028009:1":{"text":"아들... 아빠는 한 입이면 돼.","source_cn":"好孩子……爸爸只吃一口就够了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CF8ABB5A5024B3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521028010:0":{"text":"그럴 순 없지. 더 많이 가져가서 잔뜩 먹도록 해.","source_cn":"这怎么行？你们多拿几个面包，把肚子填饱吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6693CD76B62D2F68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521028011:0":{"text":"와! 그래도 돼요?","source_cn":"哇——真的可以吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70C48EA1EF63CAC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521028012:0":{"text":"카토, 얼른 이 친절한 도련님께 감사하다고 인사드려!","source_cn":"卡托，快说谢谢！谢谢这位好心的小公子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23859A9444872C07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521028013:0":{"text":"자, 잠깐. 날 알아?","source_cn":"等、等一下！你认识我？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66FD878E36368154","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521028014:0":{"text":"아뇨, 처음 뵙는 분이신데요.","source_cn":"不，我从未见过您。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE623CD53A47B7C4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521028015:0":{"text":"그런데 왜 날 “도련님”이라고 불러?","source_cn":"那你为什么叫我“小公子”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E32E4666BA59212","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521028016:1":{"text":"지금 같은 상황에서 남은 식량을 나눠줄 수 있는 사람은 분명 부자거나 귀한 분일 테니까요. 게다가 곁에 하인까지 둘이나 있으니, 도련님이라고 부르는 게 결례는 아니겠죠.","source_cn":"现在这种时候，能从家里拿出余粮分给我们的人肯定非富即贵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4EFB551BC9D7380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1521028016":{"text":"지금 같은 상황에서 남은 식량을 나눠줄 수 있는 사람은 분명 부자거나 귀한 분일 테니까요. 게다가 곁에 하인까지 둘이나 있으니, 도련님이라고 부르는 게 결례는 아니겠죠.","source_cn":"现在这种时候，能从家里拿出余粮分给我们的人肯定非富即贵，更何况您身边还跟着两位仆人。只有这样称呼您才不会失礼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4EFB551BC9D7380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521028017:0":{"text":"...저희는 하인이 아니에요.","source_cn":"……我们不是他的仆人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F39AEA12B38CA99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521028019:0":{"text":"그건...","source_cn":"这……<key:dialog52>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA71C5CD171988A5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521028020:0":{"text":"이 둘은 하인이 아니라 내 호위병이야.","source_cn":"他们是我的护卫，不是仆人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CC1C7D6FE4618D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1521028021:0":{"text":"오오, 제가 제대로 봤군요... 역시 친절하신 도련님이 맞았어요.","source_cn":"哦哦，我果然没看错……您果然是位好心的公子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75D59D8654E40A1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1521028022:0":{"text":"도련님... 뭐 하나 물어봐도 돼요?","source_cn":"小公子……我可以问你一个问题吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7922886FF44AD2AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1521028023:0":{"text":"응, 물어봐.","source_cn":"可以啊，你问吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39B317B0A8EA3738","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1521028024:0":{"text":"저기... 영주님을 뵌 적이 있으세요?","source_cn":"那个……你有没有见过领主殿下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x299BCF841CDEB298","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1521028025:0":{"text":"...카토!\n아빠가 밖에서 영주님 얘기 하면 안 된다고 했잖아!","source_cn":"——卡托！\\n爸爸和你说过，不许在外面议论领主的事……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21D564BCFAAA947F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1521028026:1":{"text":"죄송합니다, 도련님. 방금 그 말은 신경쓰지 않으셔도 됩니다. 아들이 그냥 궁금해서 그랬던 거예요.","source_cn":"抱歉……小公子，您别在意卡托说的话，他只是好奇而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BB45984EF9E07F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1521028027:1":{"text":"성에 도는 영주님과 관련된 소문 같은 건 전혀 들은 적이 없습니다... 제가 아들을 따끔하게 혼내겠습니다.","source_cn":"城里那些关于领主殿下的流言我们也没听说过……我会好好教...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C3F8E4D4A838950","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1521028028:0":{"text":"레고스는 말을 마치자마자, 카토를 혼내는 것처럼 끌고 황급히 도망갔다.","source_cn":"雷古斯说完后，就匆匆拉着卡托走远，看起来像是在教训他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x867C5D35771E138C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1521028029:0":{"text":"혹시 날 알아본 걸까...?","source_cn":"他们是不是认出我了……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BCC9BD60EA43AF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:41:1521028029":{"text":"혹시 날 알아본 걸까...?","source_cn":"他们是不是认出我了……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BCC9BD60EA43AF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1521028030:0":{"text":"그럼 왜 저렇게 도망가는 거지?","source_cn":"不是的话，他们为什么要避开？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x329B6D8ECC8B6121","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1521028031:0":{"text":"방금 말한 소문 때문일지도 몰라요.","source_cn":"可能和他说的流言有关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96DD6BFD37B75B25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1521028032:1":{"text":"당신이 그 소문을 영주에게 전하면 벌을 받을까봐 무서웠던 거겠죠.","source_cn":"他害怕你会把这些事告诉领主，让他们受到惩罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x467D4516E2D7510B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1521028033:1":{"text":"하지만 난 소문 때문에 다른 사람에게 벌을 주진 않아.","source_cn":"可是我不会因为流言就惩罚别人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE59703C36780C9F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:48:1521028033":{"text":"하지만 난 소문 때문에 다른 사람에게 벌을 주진 않아.","source_cn":"可是我不会因为流言就惩罚别人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE59703C36780C9F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_